///
/// Typically a [Drawer].
///
/// To open the drawer, use the [ScaffoldState.openEndDrawer] function.
///
/// To close the drawer, use either [ScaffoldState.closeEndDrawer], [Navigator.pop]
/// or press the escape key on the keyboard.
